# STACK CONFIG FILES ARE PER-MACHINE HERE, which is why they are ignored rather than committed as
# Pulumi's own docs suggest. `kontra-control:workspaces` is an absolute host path — the same path on
# both sides of every bind mount, because a Source id is `at:<absolute path>` — so a committed
# `Pulumi.local.yaml` would be one operator's home directory in everybody else's install.
#
# `Pulumi.yaml` itself is NOT matched: the pattern needs a stack segment between the two dots.
Pulumi.*.yaml

# `pulumi stack export`/`import` scratch and any accidental local backend.
.pulumi/
